     "answer": "C（细节题）Measuring where we've come from instead of measuring against the goal.",
     "evidence": "P4\nWe measure against the goal, rather than where we've come from. ... In measuring where we've come from, rather than where we're trying to get to, we see results. ... It's a simple, yet profound change in perception ... yet has an immediate, positive impact on our thinking.\n我们对着目标来衡量，而不是衡量自己走过了多远。……当我们衡量自己走过了多远、而非衡量离要去的地方还差多少时，我们就看到了成果。……这是一种简单却深刻的认知转变……却对我们的思维有着即时而正面的影响。",
